&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Digital Product Designer – E-Commerce / Web Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce &amp;amp; Customer Experience / Web Team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Individual Contributor Lead (Staff Level)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille / Paris&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Context &amp;amp; Project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon&#39;s purpose is to bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all, guiding our overarching ambition to build a &lt;strong&gt;Local Human Bond&lt;/strong&gt; and deliver accessible, unique sporting solutions globally. In this context, our goal is to build personalized, enriched experiences across all digital touchpoints and physical stores, leveraging Digital, Data, and AI to elevate the global customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The E-Commerce Web Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the digital front door for millions of sport practice enthusiasts around the globe, our web platform (decathlon.country) must seamlessly convert online curiosity into real-world sport experiences. Our challenge is to transform a massive, multi-category web store into an intuitive, frictionless digital portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need to guide every user—from a first-time visitor searching for sports goods to a returning member—through a smooth journey that connects online browsing directly with local store availability, click-and-collect, and circular services like rentals and repairs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By building a standardized, modular web experience, we equip country teams and international franchise partners with pre-validated, high-converting funnel journeys so they can scale local commerce effortlessly without rebuilding core web experiences from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope &amp;amp; Structure (4 Dedicated E-Com Squads)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn global internet users into active visitors through high-converting landing experiences, SEO, campaign entry points, and personalized traffic onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Help users find the exact product or advice they need within a vast catalog through intelligent search, taxonomy, filtering, and catalog hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decision:&lt;/strong&gt; Give users every compelling reason to choose a product using rich product detail pages (PDP), media, sizing confidence, customer reviews, and circular/sustainability options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversion:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver frictionless checkout, flexible payment methods, order self-tracking, store pickup options, and effortless returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Digital Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;, you operate as a principal individual contributor and strategic leader within the Decathlon E-Commerce team. Operating with high autonomy on complex, cross-squad web challenges, you shape our long-term&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web Experience Vision&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in close triad leadership with &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Managers (GPMs)&lt;/strong&gt;, while partnering hand-in-hand with a &lt;strong&gt;dedicated UX Researcher (UXR)&lt;/strong&gt; as your main practice partner to ground every design decision in deep user insights and quantitative data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond defining strategy, you lead &lt;strong&gt;hands-on experimentation, product de-risking, and rapid validation loops&lt;/strong&gt;—ensuring high-stakes web features across Acquisition, Navigation, Decision, and Conversion are proven through A/B testing, CRO analysis, and real user data before global rollout. You align the 4 web squads around a unified web vision, accelerate commercial value delivery, and elevate design craft maturity across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Alignment &amp;amp; Web Funnel Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triad Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Staff Engineers, Staff PMs, and your dedicated UXR partner to define long-term roadmaps, tech feasibility, and strategic UX priorities across squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Experience Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and advocate for the long-term web design strategy, establishing web principles that influence product and commercial roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-Squad Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment across the &lt;strong&gt;Acquisition, Navigation, Decision, and Conversion&lt;/strong&gt; squads to ensure a cohesive end-to-end web journey without siloed user friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Priority Segment Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Set strategic web UX direction tailored to key user segments (&lt;strong&gt;Families, New Customers, Members&lt;/strong&gt;), driving personalization and context-aware landing journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macro Metrics Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and optimize web performance metrics across the full funnel: &lt;strong&gt;SEO Traffic, CTR, Search Success, Add-to-Cart Rate, Conversion Rate, and Retention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product De-Risking &amp;amp; Web Experimentation Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research Partner Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work hand-in-hand with UXR to formulate hypotheses, map user knowledge gaps, and design research strategies for complex e-commerce flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De-Risking Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Formulate and drive product de-risking strategies for high-impact web initiatives—identifying usability, commercial, and technical risks early in discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concrete Web Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute hands-on A/B tests, multivariate testing, CRO experiments, and prototype usability tests across the 4 squads to validate hypotheses before engineering rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Informed Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Data &amp;amp; Analytics leads to build quantitative testing frameworks, leveraging web analytics to guide roadmap trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Culture Elevation:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach web product squads on hypothesis formulation, CRO best practices, and rapid build-measure-learn loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities (Skills &amp;amp; Behaviors)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Web Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with our UXR to enrich foundational customer knowledge (B2C web journeys) and co-define a CX vision to build collective alignment across stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover drop-off points across the 4 squads through quantitative funnel analytics and qualitative research; structure decisions using Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and prototype web interfaces early and often; design high-converting, accessible, and responsive layouts connected to our Design System.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; CRO:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously de-risk solution feasibility, usability, and conversion lift using context-tailored testing tools (A/B testing, user testing, CRO analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Exploration:&lt;/strong&gt; Test and integrate AI tools (e.g., generative search, smart recommendations, automated layout testing) to amplify design and research workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead cross-squad web taskforces alongside Staff Engineering and Staff PMs, make sound decisions under partial data, and support the Design Manager in org planning and hiring committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Emotional Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Work proactively across PMs, Engineering Managers, and Business Leads to shape priorities using emotional intelligence and data-backed storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Involve engineering, data, UXR, and SEO teams early in the design process to create a psychologically safe, feedback-rich environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate the web design practice by mentoring 3–4 designers, facilitating cross-squad design critiques, and connecting design solutions across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn failed A/B experiments into collective learning opportunities and maintain a structured personal growth plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Why Join the E-Commerce Web Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenges You Will Tackle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Scale Web Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimizing a global web platform handling millions of daily visits across dozens of international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4-Squad Synergy:&lt;/strong&gt; Unifying &lt;strong&gt;Acquisition, Navigation, Decision, and Conversion&lt;/strong&gt; into one fluid, frictionless web journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Triad Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Working in direct alignment with Staff Engineering, Staff PMs, and a dedicated UXR partner to shape high-level product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Accessibility at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing lightweight, lightning-fast web pages that meet strict WCAG accessibility and SEO benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Role Is a Perfect Match for You If…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive on &lt;strong&gt;de-risking web journeys via A/B testing and CRO data&lt;/strong&gt; rather than subjective opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You excel at &lt;strong&gt;triad collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with Staff Tech and Staff PMs, backed by deep research partnership with UXR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy &lt;strong&gt;orchestrating design across multiple squads&lt;/strong&gt; (Acquisition through Conversion) to deliver a unified customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance &lt;strong&gt;commercial conversion into&amp;nbsp; goals with high design standards and accessibility&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love &lt;strong&gt;mentoring designers&lt;/strong&gt; and upskilling teams in experimentation, data literacy, and web craft excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shift delivers AI agents that transform insurers&#39; most critical work. By combining deep industry expertise and unmatched data resources, Shift provides proven results that have earned the trust of hundreds of the world&#39;s leading insurers. Our insurance-grade AI is accurate, explainable, and secure—empowering human experts to move with unmatched speed, total confidence, and a renewed focus on the people they serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video poster=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/thumbnail-violet.jpg&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;source src=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video%20(English).mp4&quot; type=&quot;video/mp4&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your browser does not support the video tag.&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Shift, we are building the next generation of AI-driven platform capabilities. We are looking for an experienced, hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Staff AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as the technical anchor for our AI capabilities; someone who is deeply passionate about building, prototyping, and scaling modern AI/LLM systems, while helping shape our broader AI engineering strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, high-visibility role for a senior builder who excels at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;cutting-edge AI technologies&lt;/strong&gt; (Agentic frameworks, LLM orchestration, MCP, GenAI) and &lt;strong&gt;production-grade software engineering&lt;/strong&gt;. You will work directly with data scientists, software engineers, and product leaders to design, prototype, and ship state-of-the-art AI systems into production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a senior AI engineer looking for the next step in your career -where you can drive architectural strategy and mentor others &lt;strong&gt;without giving up hands-on coding and building&lt;/strong&gt;- this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Architect Agentic Systems (Hands-On):&lt;/strong&gt; Lead by doing. Design, prototype, and build production-ready agentic workflows, custom orchestration layers, and tool-calling integrations using modern frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge AI &amp;amp; Production Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Move AI prototypes into robust, production-grade microservices on Azure. Ensure AI components are scalable, low-latency, and well-integrated into the broader tech stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement Next-Gen AI Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Experiment with and integrate emerging paradigms into our production stack, including Model Context Protocol (MCP), advanced RAG patterns, vector pipelines, and structured LLM outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI Quality &amp;amp; LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and implement operational frameworks for experiment tracking, evaluations, prompt engineering, latency optimization, token budget governance, and model observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Upskill:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical mentor for agent-focused engineering squads. Lead technical design reviews, set coding standards, and help elevate the team&#39;s AI engineering capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay at the Cutting Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously benchmark new models, AI tools, and architectures, translating relevant breakthroughs into practical, value-driving implementations at Shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a seasoned AI engineer who combines deep, practical expertise in modern GenAI/LLM ecosystems with strong backend software engineering skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep AI &amp;amp; Agentic Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On Agentic Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience building with frameworks like Microsoft Agent Framework, LangGraph, LlamaIndex, OpenAI Agents SDK, or custom orchestration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM Patterns &amp;amp; Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience with Model Context Protocol (MCP), tool/function calling, structured LLM outputs, and complex RAG pipelines (vector retrieval, hybrid search, embeddings).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLMOps &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with evaluation frameworks, prompt engineering, tracing, context window optimization, and compute/token governance in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Engineering &amp;amp; Stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; (required for AI ecosystem work) paired with strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;OOP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; APIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building and scaling backend microservices and REST/OpenAPI endpoints in enterprise cloud environments (specifically &lt;strong&gt;Azure&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Events:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with vector databases, relational databases, and event-driven patterns (e.g., Azure Service Bus, Kafka).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable with containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), CI/CD, testing methodologies, and Infrastructure as Code (Terraform or Bicep).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jump in and get things done:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a proactive builder who loves turning ambitious ideas into working code. You don&#39;t wait for permission to solve hard problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make things simpler:&lt;/strong&gt; You can break down complex AI concepts and architectures into clear, executable steps for engineers, data scientists, and non-technical partners alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test &amp;amp; learn new things:&lt;/strong&gt; You are genuinely obsessed with the fast-moving AI landscape. You constantly experiment with new models, libraries, and papers, and know how to extract real product value from the hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate with impact &amp;amp; help others grow:&lt;/strong&gt; You lead by example and collaboration, upskilling team members through pair programming, code reviews, and pragmatic design discussions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-RH1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To support our permanent, full time employees at every stage of their careers and lives, we provide a competitive total rewards and benefits package. Here are the global benefits we’d like to highlight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible remote and hybrid working options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary and a variable component tied to personal and company performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Multiple Learning and Development opportunities, including Focus Fridays, a half-day each month to focus on learning and personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mental health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2 MAD Days per year (Make A Difference Days for paid volunteering)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Additional benefits may be offered by country, based on your eligibility - ask your recruiter for more information. Intern and Apprentice positions may receive some of these benefits - ask your recruiter for more details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI tools are used to help review applications for this role. Read our &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shift-technology.com/hubfs/AI%20in%20Recruitment%20Notice%20May%202026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI in Recruitment Notice&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for what the AI considers, how to request a human review, and our most recent bias audit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Shift we strive to be a diverse and inclusive workforce. &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from and hire people who will contribute to the diversity of our company,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;without regard to race, color, religion, marital status, age, national or ethnic origin, physical or mental disability, medical condition, pregnancy, genetic information, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or other non-merit criteria. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our application and employment process. Should you require accommodation, please email ----- and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
